//! Slice 2 review: A lattice column bound to a `let` copy of another is a join on a lattice value: BLS0304.

program b6 version 1;
input seed(k: u64, v: u64);
table a(k: u64, v: LMax<u64>);
table b(k: u64, v: LMax<u64>);
feed: on seed(k, v) { emit a(k, v); emit b(k, v); }
view eq(k) = a(k, x), let y = x, b(k, y);
